{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>牛奶盒上有小凹位是要過期，還是瑕疵品？港人最愛買的北海道特選3.6牛乳包裝都無膠蓋，未飲完要怎儲存？大家對於日本牛奶是否有許多疑問？一於等《香港01》「好食玩飛」記者為大家揭開日本牛奶盒的4個設計秘密。</p><p>你可覺得北海道牛乳的包裝很奇怪？甚至有網民表示「它的包裝勁弱智」，也有人因為這樣而轉飲其他品牌的牛奶。不過，最令人困擾是對於那些沒有蓋的1公升盒裝牛奶，開封後應該如何保存？「北海道特選3.6牛乳」官方facebook原來有實用教學，教大家如何簡單方法，把開口摺好。其實，日本牛奶盒令港人不解的設計豈只一個？為什麼牛奶盒有小凹位？為什麼不少牛奶盒是屋形設計？點擊圖片睇記者為大家揭開日本牛奶盒4個設計秘密 👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061204441042944096547.jpeg/jEJEN0hFUS2RFsikWKWvQiRLcg5IOoH4uhSXXroUl14\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061207012282368263159.jpeg/y6oAyrQ_mf7R2f_LP_tHgB0hzvEaf-M_4PujIOD7oyA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061209411555328602718.jpeg/yx1bSMBuoQz43_zANu6BOIHn3P0-bhqTuVVQ3LlVUNw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061212196704256597128.jpeg/nPDhNc5a5PQx_IQPUan560FW_iREmBpNgPPbooDz26I\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061214608560128453608.jpeg/b0e19Ium-jG9u5FBtEwe2FaD5CFK5qqpMSAnSDEgJ0g\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061216831672320548021.jpeg/N59lDpeU8qBMCCZlL7sTI_119ZZNMjqX3aYfpt2mH6Y\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061219704901632450962.jpeg/UXrUokLUmOumew57_YGGTot4C9s6NA2OQ49cAEOPXAA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061222540382208190827.jpeg/NWa6pfT-FcA0tBX1Lt5IdIG0z-9C2msKolALkaJQC5E\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061225136787456783692.jpeg/B9Z7E9OlE1-TVTI8pLXKQ9bINhrHxrw1fRSUtn0UlLY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061228341366784647158.jpeg/PM9o6KgCYEg1mmPHiGQzW46VWMzQd8yfHZJFvB2SRbw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061191182848000045319.jpeg/N0DOoUCg_sW2IchilNzKifRRM_Umnv83FYE8ThWBPE4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061193825390592895017.jpeg/3fEDHRI2G04hU4thLYqp7BBuXH1tyLZeurU2Pbq1Nj0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061195830398976459701.jpeg/xrOi-QzPOLRNeMKQ9f4nTSJ1l6astn2A5XRUQ-V0VEM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201116/405061198011568128640598.jpeg/aLScyKWqyqogLvi9V86VxU8uwnJpvJ4muQTqlbkE6pU\"/><p>想知更多有助放鬆心情嘅香港好去處，例如離島、沙灘、單車、郊遊路線，click 入專頁睇更多推介！👉👉 香港好去處｜假日郊遊、離島放空、單車路線、食玩打卡｜不斷更新</p><p>😍😍😍 同場加映：DONKI網民票選10大最受歡迎美食　招牌甜薯無上榜　第1位不負眾望 😍😍😍</p><p>DON DON DONKI驚安之殿堂將軍澳分店在11月11日開幕後人龍依舊不絕，當中就有大大個熟食區提供各款日式小食讓大家「解日本鄉愁」。最近DONKI亦公開網民票選「10款最想喺DON DON DONKI食到嘅日式小食/飲品」，大家最想食邊款？👇👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201110/402887548600455168650312.jpeg/4jhCooUex8edCzJ8xW8u2iwMr94HGd-jDiFMdg4hTHY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201110/402887551150723072129560.jpeg/dkt5IHCo5tT6YcVrWGGpNUNTJtQD3HU9EKJkDBCiZAw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201110/402887554296582144791485.jpeg/73UJuYic2YNUQAJKe6oXqExao07StnSgsUUpELFFKRA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201110/402887557392109568832956.jpeg/gZnrggoE77LYQHUVaMHkyreSK359UkizrGrcnqxq3J4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201110/402887559950766080928346.jpeg/kBgUnQGbUn5iMR8KdLv-dowhMmP6tvvvZYEFSGWBBUg\"/><p>想知完整排名立即點擊睇全文 👉👉 DONKI網民票選10大最受歡迎美食　招牌甜薯無上榜　第1位不負眾望</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T03:18:51.682185+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":615,"images":19,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}